INDEPENDENT VARIABLES 
 
#  The original data are available for center of mass energies 1.e-3 to 
#  100 eV. The reduced mass for the system is ra_mass, in the reactions
#  list below.  The cross section specific energy range is obtained by
#  dividing the c-of-m range by ra_mass (in AMU). The specific energy
#  range for the integrals is the c-of-m range divided by the test
#  species mass (in AMU). Likewise, divide by the background species mass
#  to get the specific temperature range. The scattering angle range
#  is the same as for the cross section.

